      "value": "sounds like what i'm seeing here\n\navatar: avtr_8df5013e-8b74-4453-a2dc-3904e8a72f47\n\n- enable Toggles/Stretch Cube\n\n- turn on Drop to world-drop it\n\n- have another user sit on the cube\n\n- turn around\n\nthe station (and consequently person on the cube) will jitter despite the cube itself appearing to remain locked in place.\n\nBuild 1866 (unity-6 beta)",
