  "details": "If a avatar chair is attached to or on a object that is frozen in place to the world by the use of any type of constraints.  The person sitting in the chair will exerience extreme massive amount of jitter whenever the owner of the chair turn around.  \n\nThe jitter get more worst if the owner get more far away from the chair.\n\nThe jitter did not really occur until recently.",
